/-! ## Negative control: value asymptotics do not give derivative control

`x ↦ 1 + x⁷ sin((x⁸)⁻¹)` on `(0, ∞)` has value remainder `O(x⁷)`: **every** value coefficient
below order 7 is that of the constant `1`. Its actual derivative, however, is
